{
  "message": "I can help with that. Quick overview of our exchange process: \n- Exchanges are available only for delivered orders. \n- Each item can be swapped only for a different option of the same product (e.g., a different color/option of the same kettle model). If you want a different kettle model, we’ll need to do a return instead. \n- Only one exchange/return can be requested per delivered order, so please include everything now. \n- Any price difference will be charged or refunded to a payment method you choose (gift cards must have enough balance). \n- After you confirm, I’ll submit the exchange request; you’ll get an email with return instructions—no need to place a new order.",
  "to_get_started": [
    "1) Authenticate you: please provide your email. If you don’t recall it, share your first and last name plus your ZIP code.",
    "2) Order details: the order ID (or say “find my recent delivered orders” and I’ll look it up after authentication).",
    "3) Items and replacements: which two tea kettles from that order you want to exchange and the exact options you want instead (must be the same product, different option). If you want a different kettle model, tell me and we’ll switch to a return.",
    "4) Payment method for any price difference: credit card, PayPal, or a gift card."
  ],
  "confirmation_note": "Please also confirm these are the only items you want to exchange from this order."
}

